This independent extension integrates with COVE's public extension SDK and runtime.
COVE: https://github.com/yourcove/cove (GNU Affero General Public License v3).
The extension does not bundle COVE, its runtime React libraries, or host assemblies.

The interface was informed by an earlier local annotation tool. No scene media,
user annotation files, credentials or private database contents are distributed here.
